<title>CANADA: Nova Scotia sets 2006 C$250 mln 7.25 pct bond.</title>
<headline>Nova Scotia sets 2006 C$250 mln 7.25 pct bond.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The government of the Canadian province of Nova Scotia issued a C$250 million 7.25 percent bond due October 11, 2006 at a price of C$99.559 to yield 7.313 percent for a spread of 31 basis points over the Government of Canada 8.75 percent bond due 2005, lead manager RBC Dominion Securities Inc said.</p>
<p>The bond will be dated and delivered October 11, 1996.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100</p>
</text>
